  "text": "proprium.dominica-xx-post-pentecosten-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “20th Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": {
      "translation": "O Lord, we beseech You, graciously grant Your faithful forgiveness and peace, that they may be cleansed of all sin and serve You with minds free from care. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen."
    }
  },
